<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ssl on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/ssl/</link><description>Recent content in Ssl on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 06 Jul 2022 12:07:22 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/ssl/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Docker Images Again</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/dockertig/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 Jul 2022 12:07:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/dockertig/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="devops-docker-images-again"&gt;Devops Docker images again&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Another Docker image with some tools useful for devops, this time includes the &lt;a href="https://jonas.github.io/tig/"&gt;TIG CLI utility&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="tig"&gt;Tig&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Tig Docker image &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-tig"&gt;https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-tig&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To use run the following;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h4 id="directly-on-the-cli"&gt;Directly on the CLI&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -ti -v &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;pwd&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;:/mnt ghcr.io/alastairhm/docker-tig:latest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id="as-an-alias"&gt;As an alias&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;alias tig&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;docker run --rm -ti -v $(pwd):/mnt ghcr.io/alastairhm/docker-tig:latest&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For full instructions on using TIG visit the &lt;a href="https://jonas.github.io/tig/doc/manual.html"&gt;offical instructions page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker Images</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/dockerimages/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Sep 2021 12:07:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/dockerimages/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="devops-docker-images"&gt;Devops Docker images&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve built a few Docker images with some tools useful for devops lately.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="spacevim"&gt;SpaceVim&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;SpaceVim Docker image with NeoVim &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/spacevim"&gt;https://github.com/alastairhm/spacevim&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="cfssl"&gt;CFSSL&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;CloudFlare&amp;rsquo;s SSL tools Docker image &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-cfssl"&gt;https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-cfssl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="terraform-security"&gt;Terraform Security&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;TFSec and TFLint tools Docker image &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-terraform-check"&gt;https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-terraform-check&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="bitwarden-cli"&gt;Bitwarden CLI&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden CLI tool Docker image &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-bw"&gt;https://github.com/alastairhm/docker-bw&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>